                     <content styleCode="bold">Inactive Ingredients</content>
                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>ammonium glycyrrhizate, flavors, geleol mono and diglycerides, glucode syrup, maltitol solution, maltodextrin, neotame, polyethylene glycol 400, povidone K30, propylene glycol, purified water, seaweed extract (carrageenan), sodium chloride, starch, sucralose, sucrose, trisodium citrate dihydrate.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20230701"/>
